    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ke nkitanapat aashu enkirukoto?",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lo Galatia oomoda, aing'ae natasakuto intae? Amu eibalakinyeki intae tukul enchoto natashoki Yesu Kristo metotiwuo anaa itoduaa too nkonyek inyi maate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entolikioki naa ena nabo; ei nena Kitanapat intabaitie pee itang'amutua Enkiyang'et anaa kenkirukoto niruko Lomon Supati apa pee ining'ining'i? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kesipa nchere imodada enaba nji? Enkaraki Enkiyang'et e Enkai pee nterutua enkishui inyi ng'ejuk. Ijojo pasa indimidimi aaitabai mbaa katukul ti ae oitai neme nkiyang'et? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keton eeta tipat te intae nena baa pooki naaimunyeki intae? Mme neijia sii ake etiu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaa ilo oisho intae Enkiyang'et enye neas ine nking'asia ti atua intae. Ketaasa enkaraki naa nkitanapat intabaitie ana kenkaraki niruko Lomon Supati apa pee ining'ining'i? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.15.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 15.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.4.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Irm 4.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ejo Lkigerot, “Enkai eiruko Abraham; ore enkaraki ina neikenaki Enkai ninye ajo eeta esipata.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Irm 4.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neijia sii etiu te intae. Ajo naa sii ake idolidolo aajo lelo ooata enkirukoto oora nkera e Abraham. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 12.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ejo Lkigerot, ti alo Abraham, ilo tung'ani oiruko, “Ti atua iyie emayiani Loreren pooki;” naa te lelo rorei etolikioki apa ninye eton etiooyo kulo Omon Supati. Enkata eitodoluaki nayooki Enkai aikenaki Loreren isipat te nkaraki enkirukoto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ore ilooiruk pooki nemaiyiana te nebo ilo Abraham oiruko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 27.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore lelo pooki ooigarakino enkitabaroto oo Nkitanapat netii abori oldeket, amu ejo lkigerot, “Etediaaki pooki ng'ae lemeas nena pooki naaigero too nkitanapat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAB.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hab 2.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neibala nchere meetae hoo obo lemeetakinore Enkai enkaraki naitabayie ninye Nkitanapat, amu ejo Lkigerot, “Ore pooki ng'ae lemeetakinore Enkai ninye enkaraki enkirukoto nepok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 18.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake mme nabo tukul Nkitanapat o enkirukoto, amu ejo Nkitanapat, “Ti niaas nena naajo Nkitanapat nipok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 21.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kristo oinyiang'ua iyiook asaru to ldeket loo Nkitanapat etanapa ninye makewan ilo deket te nkaraki iyiook, amu ejo Lkigerot, “Kediaa pooki ng'ae oilili to lchani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paa te Kristo Yesu ebaiki emayianata e Enkai natamayiana Abraham Iloreren, neaku enkirukoto eimu ina pee king'amu iyiook enkishorunoto e Nkiyang'et natolimuoki apake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkitanapata o enkisiligata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lalashera laainei aisho intae enkitanyaanyukoto oo ltung'ana. Entadamu embae natoning'okinote ltung'ana aare. Ore pee eaku eidipa nemeitokini aata oloiwuang'ie arashu eponaa, hoo naa olning'o ake otoning'okinote ltung'ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 12.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore too Lkigerot naa Abraham eishooki nkisiligat o ilo oiu ninye. Neitu eji, “O looiu ninye,” aajo ilkumok, kake obo etoiwuoki. Ore ilo obo naa Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 12.40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ena doi ajo nanu; ore nena Kitanapat naaetuo enyaakita aalusoo larin iip ong'uan o tomoni uni, nemeidim ninche aaiwuang'ie osotua oidipa Enkai atuno, nemeidim aaibooi enkisiligata enye pee meaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.4.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Irm 4.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Te naa to Nkitanapat kitum enkishorunoto e Nkai, nemeitoki naa aaku enkisiligata enye eitabayioki; kake ore enkishorunoto e Enkai naishoo Abraham pesho naa enkisiligata enye eitabayie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaa tipat naa apake eeta ninche Nkitanapat pee eetae? Eishoruaki pee eyiolouni engilata oo nkitanapat aajo ainyoo oshi ninche, kake eishooki metobiko o metabau ilo oiu naa ninye apa eipirieki enkisiligata naitayioki. Too lmalaika apa eitarasuaki aaimunye nkaik o lkilikuai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore embae naa obo oas nemeetayieki tipat olkilikuai. Naa nabo Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enaipirta enkitanapata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
